Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.49,0:00:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Futon, clothes, shoes, toothbrush...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.52,0:00:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wasn't there something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.54,0:00:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, don't go and pull disappearing acts like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.70,0:00:16.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It scares me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.43,0:00:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.97,0:00:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, pick a green one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.29,0:00:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come on. We're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.17,0:00:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be safer if we hold hands while we walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.47,0:00:48.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Safer for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.51,0:02:41.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want the blue one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.92,0:02:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Since when were there so many parents with children here? {Did so many parents used to bring their kids here?}{I hate the "used to" phrasing -_-}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:55.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:03:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Okay. Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.03,0:03:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What size are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.43,0:03:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.52,0:03:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:17.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What am I supposed to be comparing it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.10,0:03:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't know! {<3 <3 <3}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.40,0:03:19.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit waving your arms around!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.21,0:03:21.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What else do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pajamas! Pants! Shirts! Socks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.15,0:03:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't want a skirt?{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You've only put trousers in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.17,0:03:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They don't let us wear skirts to nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nursery!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.56,0:03:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I completely forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.57,0:03:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's Monday, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:04:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm tired, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.69,0:04:05.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's just a little further. Be strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.03,0:04:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.89,0:04:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost home, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.34,0:04:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you bunking off again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.27,0:04:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You good for nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.95,0:04:23.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're always bringing me stuff I don't need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to get mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.30,0:04:30.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that supposed to mean? Damn idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.01,0:04:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get your hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.29,0:04:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.55,0:04:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this is the Maeda residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.41,0:04:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, hello. I was sorry to hear about your recent loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.09,0:04:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san? It's Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming! Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.89,0:04:57.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:05:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I never asked for your mobile number.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How do you go about starting nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nursery?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:11.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!? You actually took Rin-chan home with you!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.27,0:05:14.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it really okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.65,0:05:18.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean by "for now"?{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:22.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, it's too late for me to take the day off tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:24.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So what's the procedure to enrol her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:27.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can't just enrol her straight away, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.66,0:05:29.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you pull some strings?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure I'm the right person to be asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You could start by asking at the city hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Sunday night.{My eyes are totally on Rin just now. XD Bounce bounce bounce...}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it!?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, just something on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.41,0:05:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, is that Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Reina!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're talking about something important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:48.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's a temporary nursery for emergencies...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A temporary nursery for emergencies?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, Dai-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan! Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.36,0:05:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, no, just something on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.01,0:05:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be done in a minute. Just wait a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.60,0:06:02.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san, I'm taking the miso soup off the stove.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it sounds like you're pretty busy, so I'll call back la{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:17.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Man, hardly any results...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, suddenly I'm going to double my work commute?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.55,0:06:24.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Yeah. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.61,0:06:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's pretty close, but I can't get out of work at six.{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Sure. Let's play again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.12,0:06:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Bye bye, Reina-chan! See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one looks pretty good,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but it says they'll only take kids on emergency notice for ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.35,0:06:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A bath...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.94,0:06:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's morning...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right... Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you sleep here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.81,0:07:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The futon feels strangely warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.74,0:07:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Take this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.59,0:07:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, about the nursery you're going to today...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the food...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Elbows off the table while you eat!{:D!}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.38,0:08:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The nursery you're going to is only taking you on a temporary basis, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.45,0:08:10.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Temporary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:14.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It means you'll go there until we can find a place to formally enrol you at.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What does "formally" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:24.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It means properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:27.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's slightly different...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, {\i1}my{\i0} hair's fine! {Italics, please~ <3}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.11,0:08:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:53.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.81,0:08:55.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.88,0:09:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.96,0:09:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,P-Put me down! Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:07.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.47,0:09:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is it embarrassing for you to have other kids see me carrying you?{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.51,0:09:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.37,0:09:32.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please take good care of her, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:35.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We will. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.31,0:10:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't give me that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I won't be able to make it back while it's light,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.65,0:10:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but I'll try to be as quick as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.66,0:10:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a pinky promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I tell a lie, I'll absolutely swallow a thousand needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:19.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My finger was cut off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:24.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You got the song wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,See you. Wait for me, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Rin. I never thought about how you felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.98,0:10:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You had no understanding of your mum's circumstances, nor of my granddad's lifespan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.10,0:10:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You only knew the pain of being left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.90,0:10:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Did you think I was going to leave you behind, as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure having that happen to you once...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.63,0:11:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...is more than enough to last you a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Read this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.16,0:11:17.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, let's grab some lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I've got something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got mine a little earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Then I'll be back in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.67,0:11:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The first day of the month and you're already in workaholic mode, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.26,0:11:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get me a photo of this sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.03,0:12:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san! There's a call for you on line four about the investors' inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.15,0:12:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.35,0:12:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.67,0:12:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.33,0:12:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:33.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.89,0:12:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:48.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes? Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.12,0:12:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:58.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.05,0:12:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Go and get changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.25,0:13:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.21,0:13:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, don't break it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.16,0:13:10.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.42,0:13:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.27,0:13:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello? Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.41,0:13:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Miyata-san from Mitsutomo Trading.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.14,0:13:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes? This is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.82,0:13:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.34,0:13:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:13:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.76,0:14:01.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be done at work in just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,#{DON'T BREAK IT. ;__;}{Ψ's mark}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The nursery is... so far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.39,0:15:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:15.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so... sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.81,0:15:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, are those crisps? They look good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:31.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Chopped vegetables!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I swallowed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.67,0:15:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...a thousand needles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, I'll leave this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.72,0:16:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san! You need to sign here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.21,0:17:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like it's actually likely,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.37,0:17:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,but what if I find a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.51,0:17:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.00,0:17:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.11,0:17:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right... Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.29,0:17:27.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi. This was supposed to go out yesterday, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.27,0:17:28.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This really isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:35.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've already apologised to the recipient, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.40,0:17:40.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I'll call them immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go for a few drinks. It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.34,0:17:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, tonight's no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.61,0:17:51.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then how about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got something going on then, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:17:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I get it. Sounds like someone's getting lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.72,0:18:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.39,0:18:26.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on tight!{Daikichi is such a loveable dork. XD}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.33,0:19:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Run away from the moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's just no end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long can I keep living like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These are Rin-chan's things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.73,0:19:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is all that she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.07,0:20:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her mother and child health record and other important documents are here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's only for a short while,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.06,0:20:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,raising a child is a terribly difficult job.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:11.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Surely, Rin is the one who has it the hardest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.98,0:20:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I'm just going to have a little look in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.67,0:20:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Her mouth's still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.95,0:20:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All of the relatives talk about you like you're some sort of supervillain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.92,0:20:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I wonder... Who's the real villain, Masako-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.16,0:22:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Feeling sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.47,0:22:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So you've decided to sleep over there aft{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.31,0:22:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.96,0:22:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What!? D-Did I...?! {XD! Daikichi peeing the bed~~}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.57,0:22:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.59,0:22:45.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, sure. It's sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.79,0:22:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.46,0:22:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll change the sheets, so give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.51,0:22:51.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said that it's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.47,0:22:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And I agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,##{SIGNS}##
